  "title": "Bangladesh's Protests Over Sheikh Hasina's December Return and Exile",
  "summary": "Violent protests and killings in Bangladesh ahead of Sheikh Hasina's planned return in December, as the Awami League party called for nationwide protests. The government rejected her request for a passport, leading to clashes and arson attacks, with her ancestral home set ablaze. Hasina's Awami League party aimed to mobilize support for her return, culminating in a nationwide lockdown.",
